                <p class="text-gray-600">
                  Yes, your payment information is secure. MultiMarket uses industry-standard encryption and security protocols to protect your data. We are PCI DSS compliant, which means we follow strict security standards for handling credit card information. We never store your full credit card details on our servers. Instead, we use tokenization through our secure payment processors to handle transactions.
