                  Shipping is handled by individual merchants. Each merchant sets their own shipping rates, methods, and policies. When you purchase from multiple merchants in a single order, each merchant will ship their items separately. Shipping costs and delivery times are displayed during checkout, and you can track each shipment separately through your order history.
